<div class="embla__slide">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2>Юнит-Экономика и Окупаемость</h2>
    {% set included = ["серверная инфраструктура", "сторонние API", "комиссии платёжных шлюзов"] %}
    {% if dashboard.operations_payroll_monthly %}{% set included = included + ["ФОТ бэкофиса (см. Team Payroll)"] %}{% endif %}
    {% if dashboard.hardware_amortization_monthly %}{% set included = included + ["амортизация устройств (см. Hardware Amortization)"] %}{% endif %}
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #888; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 30px; font-style: italic;">
      * Учитываются {{ included|join(", ") }}. Налоги и маркетинг исключены.
    </p>
    <div class="dashboard-grid">
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value {{ dashboard.margin_color }}">{{ "%.1f"|format(dashboard.margin_pct) }}%</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Валовая маржа (Gross Margin)</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">ARPU: $<span title="${{ "%.2f"|format(dashboard.arpu) }}">{{ dashboard.arpu|compact(decimals=2, small_decimals=2) }}</span> | COGS: <span class='{{ dashboard.budget_color }}' title="${{ "%.2f"|format(dashboard.cogs) }}">${{ dashboard.cogs|compact(decimals=2, small_decimals=2) }}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value text-blue">{{ dashboard.bep_display }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Точка безубыточности (Break-Even)</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Постоянные расходы: $<span title="${{ dashboard.fixed_monthly|commas }}">{{ dashboard.fixed_monthly|compact }}</span>/мес</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value text-white" title="${{ dashboard.infra_fixed_monthly|commas }}">${{ dashboard.infra_fixed_monthly|compact }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Infrastructure Baseline</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Сырые серверные косты (без з/п)</div>
      </div>
      {% if dashboard.operations_payroll_monthly %}
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value text-white" title="${{ dashboard.operations_payroll_monthly|commas }}">${{ dashboard.operations_payroll_monthly|compact }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Team Payroll (Ops)</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">ФОТ бэкофиса из operations_team.yaml</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if dashboard.hardware_amortization_monthly %}
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value text-white" title="${{ dashboard.hardware_amortization_monthly|commas }}">${{ dashboard.hardware_amortization_monthly|compact }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Hardware Amortization</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">$<span title="${{ "%.2f"|format(dashboard.hardware_amortization_usd_per_user) }}">{{ dashboard.hardware_amortization_usd_per_user|compact(decimals=2, small_decimals=2) }}</span>/user × MAU</div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value text-green" title="${{ dashboard.mrr|commas }}">${{ dashboard.mrr|compact }}</div>
        <div class="metric-label">Прогноз MRR (Год 1)</div>
        <div class="metric-sub">Целевой MAU: <span title="{{ dashboard.mau|commas }}">{{ dashboard.mau|compact }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% if dashboard.scenarios %}
<div class="embla__slide">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2>Сценарии (Worst / Base / Best)</h2>
    <div class="dashboard-grid">
      {% for s in dashboard.scenarios %}
      <div class="metric-card">
        <div class="metric-value {{ 'text-red' if s.name == 'worst' else ('text-green' if s.name == 'best' else 'text-white') }}">{{ "%.1f"|format(s.margin_pct) }}%</div>
        <div class="metric-label">{{ s.name|upper }} — MRR $<span title="${{ s.mrr|commas }}">{{ s.mrr|compact }}</span></div>
        <div class="metric-sub">ARPU $<span title="${{ "%.2f"|format(s.arpu) }}">{{ s.arpu|compact(decimals=2, small_decimals=2) }}</span> × MAU <span title="{{ s.mau|commas }}">{{ s.mau|compact }}</span> — {{ s.driver_ref }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="embla__slide">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2>Структура выручки (Revenue Streams)</h2>
    <div class="dashboard-grid" style="display: block; text-align: left; background: #111; padding: 40px; border-radius: 0; margin-top: 40px; border: 1px solid #333;">
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Прогнозируемое распределение</h3>
        <div class="progress-bar-container">
            {% for stream in dashboard.streams %}
            <div class='progress-segment color-{{ (loop.index0 % 3) + 1 }}' style='width: {{ stream.share }}%;'></div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 30px;">
            {% for stream in dashboard.streams %}
            <li><span class='color-{{ (loop.index0 % 3) + 1 }}'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> <strong>{{ stream.share }}%</strong> - {{ stream.name }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
